<title>USA: Phillips-Van Heusen Q4 Feb 2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Phillips-Van Heusen Q4 Feb 2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		    $0.15</p>
<p> Net			  7,923		    4,134</p>
<p> Revs		     380,881		  383,641</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,035		   26,823</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.69		    $0.01</p>
<p> Net			 18,530			294</p>
<p> Revs		   1,359,593		1,464,128</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  27,004		   26,726</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Phillips-Van Heusen Corp.</p>
<p>Excluding restructuring charges, Q4 1996 net was $5.4 million, or $0.20 per share. For full-year fiscal 1996 it was $17.3 million, or $0.65 per share.</p>
